# PIOS repository policy: track only system contracts and configuration.
# All operational content, source code, assets, records, and generated output stay local.
*

# Let Git traverse directories to evaluate the exact-file allowlist below.
!*/

# Externally sourced, vendor, and nested-repository trees never form part of
# the system-contract repository, even when they contain allowlisted names.
**/raw/
**/node_modules/
**/.git/
services/personal-blog/
workspace/academic/
workspace/experiments/chess-coach/
workspace/side_projects/chess/
workspace/social_media/projects/worldcup-shorts/

# Repository metadata
!.gitignore
!.gitmodules

# PIOS system contracts and configuration
!**/manifest.yaml
!**/AGENTS.md
!**/SYSTEM.md
!**/BEHAVIOR.md
!**/SKILLS.md
!**/STATE.md
!**/TASKS.md
!**/REVIEW.md
!**/API.md
!**/README.md
!**/PRIVACY.md
!**/INDEX.md
!**/KNOWLEDGE.md
!**/ONTOLOGY.md
!**/DECISIONS.md
!**/IDEAS.md
!**/ROADMAP.md
!**/ARCHITECTURE.md
!**/ARCHITECTURE_SPEC.md
!**/JOB_ARCHIVE_STRUCTURE.md
!**/CHANGELOG.md
!**/DEPENDENCIES.md
!**/.env.example
!**/.gitkeep
!**/pyproject.toml
